        "title": "总 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "总 before a predicate describes a recurrent pattern, often with an evaluative tone. It is not a sum or merely one continuous episode.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他总帮助我。",
                "pinyin": "tā zǒng bāngzhù wǒ 。",
                "meaning": "He always helps me.",
                "audio": "97511d059bc4c58095b13d058aeb016da2252b9a10e6b18c456bfa1abf50b6bc"
              },
              {
                "text": "她总在这里学习。",
